//あります。責任の所在をお間違えなきよう」
"Let it be known, sir, that I retract my previous statement, and also make a formal declaration of no backsies!
  I was merely following orders like a good little soldier. Any blame falls squarely on the shoulders of my dear mistress."

pt:
